 2[026 format explanation](https://2026.allthingsopen.org/2026-format-overv
 iew-a-new-era)\n* [Scholarships & Discounts](https://2026.allthingsopen.or
 g/scholarships-discounts)\n* [Register Now ](https://2026.allthingsopen.or
